cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these workshop materials, please cite them as below."
title: "Single Cell RNA-seq Workshop"
abstract: "A hands-on workshop on single-cell RNA-seq analysis, covering quality control, normalization, dimensionality reduction, clustering, marker-based and reference-based annotation, multi-sample integration, pseudobulk differential expression with DESeq2, functional enrichment, and differential abundance."
type: software
